  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Это <strong>Fabric</strong>-версия мода! Получите Forge-версию здесь: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models</a></span></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"Требуется Fabric API\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\"></a></p><h3>Настраиваемые модели игроков</h3><p>Создайте персонализированный аватар с помощью редактора.</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/337/167/2021-01-30_12.png\" alt=\"Создание шляпы в редакторе\" width=\"960\" height=\"509\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Модели должны быть экспортированы, чтобы отображаться в мире. <a href=\"https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/wiki/Exporting\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/wiki/Exporting</a></span><br>Модели хранятся в неиспользуемом пространстве вашего Minecraft-скина или в виде Gist на GitHub.</p><p>Просмотрите загруженные модели на <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcpmmodels.tom5454.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">сайте моделей</a>. &nbsp;</p><p>Загрузите экспортированный файл изображения в качестве вашего скина, чтобы применить пользовательскую модель.</p><p>Дополнительные детали могут иметь собственные текстуры; можно использовать скины с более высоким разрешением <span style=\"font-size:10px\">(скин Стива из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-vanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soartex Fanver - Vanilla</a>)</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></p><p>Части стандартной модели игрока можно скрывать или перемещать.</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/337/171/cpm_examples.png\" alt=\"Примеры\" width=\"960\" height=\"509\"></p><p>Вы даже можете сделать так, чтобы части вашего скина «светились», подобно светящемуся кальмару.</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/337/173/2021-01-30_12.png\" alt=\"Свечение\" width=\"320\" height=\"272\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Сервер Discord: </span><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:Whitney, &amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:rgba(4, 4, 5, 0.07)\" href=\"https://discord.gg/mKyXdEsMZD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>https://discord.gg/mKyXdEsMZD</strong></span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Плагин для серверов Bukkit/Spigot для изменения скинов в игре (необязательно): <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/bukkit-plugins/custom-player-models-bukkit\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/bukkit-plugins/custom-player-models-bukkit</a></span></p><h3>Загрузки для каждой версии Minecraft и загрузчика:</h3><p>1.21.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.6 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.6&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.6&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.6&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a><br>1.20.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a><br>1.19.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.19.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.19.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.3 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.19.3&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.19.3&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.19.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.19.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.18.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.18.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.18.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.17.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.17.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.17.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.16.5 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.16.5&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.16.5&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.15.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.15.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.15.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.14.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.14.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.14.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.12.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.12.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.10.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.10.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.8.9 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.8.9&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.7.10 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.7.10&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.6.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.6.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.5.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.5.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.4.7 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.4.7&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.2.5 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.2.5&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></p><p>Бета 1.7.3 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=Beta 1.7.3&amp;gameVersionTypeId=17\" rel=\"nofollow\">Babric и Better Than Adventure</a></p>",
